3. VERIFICATION PROCESS & FISH LIST LEADERBOARD
Technical Requirements for Submissions
	•	Unedited Video: Must be continuously recorded from the start until the completion screen. Video editing, splicing, fast-forwarding, or post-processing tampering is strictly prohibited.
	•	Live Cable Audio Capture: Must directly record real physical click/tap sounds. Synthesized or simulated click audio will result in immediate rejection.
	•	Raw Footage & FPS: Top-tier level runs require a Raw Footage link (minimum 30 FPS) uploaded to Google Drive/Mega, with an on-screen FPS counter enabled.
	•	Valid Clients: Only Geode and Mega Hack (QoL mods) are accepted. Any use of Noclip, Auto-play, or Speedhack will result in a permanent ban.
Confidential Fake Verification Policy
	•	Submission Safety: Players submitting invalid or fake verification runs will only have their level submission rejected, without being banned from the server.
	•	Maximum Confidentiality: All chat data, raw files, and internal discussions regarding rejected submissions are kept 100% confidential.
	•	Prohibition of Leaks: Staff (@dophin, @SHARK) are strictly prohibited from taking screenshots or ridiculing fake submissions. Violations will result in immediate revocation of staff privileges.
