4. FOUR-WAY GOVERNANCE & FIH AGENT BOT OPERATIONS (JERY CODED)
The FIH AGENT Bot manages the entire economy, jail discipline, and secondary mini-game systems.
A. TeMoney Economy & Stock Trading Engine
Every new member receives an initial starting balance of 1,000 TeMoney.
	•	Asset Market (/market): Trades 5 asset tickers: MOON (MoonRock Coin), DOGE2 (Doge Squared), SRVX (Server Index), MEME (MemeCorp Shares), GOLD (Digital Gold).
	•	Automated Fluctuations: Asset prices update automatically every 60 seconds. When market rumor events occur, the bot triggers market spike or crash announcements.
	•	Dividends & Fees: Dividend-paying assets (MOON, SRVX, GOLD) automatically pay out interest every 24 hours. The buy transaction fee is 1.5%.
	•	Black Cat Credit Loans (/borrow): Emergency loans with an interest rate of 5%/day. Overdue loans not paid off via /repay will result in automatic imprisonment with mandatory debt-clearance tasks.
B. Warning System, Jail & Rehabilitation Labor (Jail System)
Members accumulating 15 warnings (/warn) are automatically placed into Jail state. Inmates have their roles temporarily stripped and must complete rehabilitation assignments to be released:
	•	Rehabilitation Typing (clean): Type the word clean the required number of times.
	•	Puzzle Challenges (!puzzle, !trivia, !answer): Correctly answer mathematical or trivia questions.
	•	Typing Speed Test (!type): Accurately transcribe 100% of the assigned text snippet.
	•	Geometry Dash Level Beat Challenge (!gdlevel): The bot randomly assigns a GD level. The player posts a completion screenshot in the jail channel, and a Moderator verifies it to release them via a ✅ reaction.
	•	Credit Repayment (/repay): Pay off the full outstanding balance of Black Cat Loans.
	•	Custom Admin Jobs: Administrators create custom tasks via /addjob and approve them using /completejob.
