Game Administration & Setup
	•	System Setup (/zsetup): Administrators use this command to automatically generate the Category "🧟 ZOMBIE APOCALYPSE", create the "Survivor" role, and set up Map roles and dedicated chat channels for each map.
	•	Game Reset (/zresetgame): Wipes all survival channels and roles to reset the game environment.
	•	Join Survival (/zjoin): Participating members are randomly assigned to a starting map.
Survival Metrics & Physical Condition
The system tracks detailed survival metrics via the /zstatus command:
	•	Overall Status: Normal, Injured, Badly Injured, Zombified.
	•	Nutrition & Energy:
	◦	Hunger: 0 - 100.
	◦	Thirst: 0 - 100.
	◦	Stamina: 0 - 10.
	◦	Rested: Fatigue levels from 0 - 5.
	•	Bone Injury:
	◦	Level 0: No injury.
	◦	Level 1: Mild hairline fracture.
	◦	Level 2: Severe bone fracture (Cannot move independently; must rely on a teammate carrying them via the /zcarry command).
	•	Daily Decay Loop: The bot automatically deducts Hunger/Thirst and increases fatigue daily. If Hunger or Thirst drops to 0, overall health drops by 1 tier.
Zombie Raid Engine
When moving or exploring facilities (/zmgo), players have a chance to encounter a Zombie Raid containing random zombie types:
	•	Zombie Archetypes:
	◦	Normal: Initial distance 70 - 100m.
	◦	Speed: Initial distance 20 - 30m (Fast movement).
	◦	Bomb: Initial distance 40 - 50m (High detection rate).
	◦	Tank: Initial distance 50 - 70m (Massive health pool).
	•	Interactive Combat Buttons:
	◦	Fight: Calculates attack power based on the best weapon in inventory + random modifier. Reduces HP of the nearest Zombie.
	◦	Retreat: Attempts to escape (Success chance drops significantly if Speed Zombies are present).
	◦	Hide: Takes cover in place to wait for the zombie horde to pass.
	•	Cornered State & Cure Serum:
	◦	If Zombies reach a distance of 0m or if 3 Raid turns elapse without defeating them all, the player becomes cornered.
	◦	If possessing Experimental Cure Serum: The system allows the user to consume the Serum to escape or take a high-stakes gamble.
	◦	If lacking Serum: The player is transformed into a Zombie (Zombified), dropping random items from their inventory.
Scouting, PvP & Trading
	•	Facility Scouting (/zscan): Costs 0.5 Stamina to scan facility safety with 70% accuracy before entering to loot.
	•	Zombie-Dex (/zdex): Logs encountered and unlocked Zombie variants.
	•	Direct Trading: Players trade items directly via interactive Accept/Decline button UI with a 60-second timeout.
	•	PvP Combat (/zpvp): Allows attacking other players in the same location (Requires both players to have PvP enabled; command cooldown is 10 minutes). The loser's health status drops by 1 tier.
